      "releaseNotes": "What's new in this update:\n\nDouble tap a workout in the feed to like it.\nAdd or change your height from Edit Profile.\nHevy now warns you right away when you complete a set with 0 reps, time or distance.\nApple Watch Ultra: set the Action Button to open Hevy.\nBug fixes and performance improvements!",
